Audiobooks uses these works by other people.

fonts/     IM Fell English, from the npm package @fontsource/im-fell-english
           5.3.0, and Alegreya Sans, from @fontsource/alegreya-sans 5.3.0.
           Both SIL Open Font License 1.1; see fonts/OFL-IMFell.txt and
           fonts/OFL-AlegreyaSans.txt.

shelf.json and more.json come from the LibriVox catalog
(https://librivox.org), with download counts from the Internet Archive
(https://archive.org). tools/build-audiobooks.mjs builds them.

The recordings are read by LibriVox volunteers and stream from the Internet
Archive. They are not stored in this repository. LibriVox places its recordings
in the public domain in the USA; copyright in other countries can differ.
